{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42074","headline":"寄庐山简寂观重道者 · 李中","name":"寄庐山简寂观重道者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昔采芝庐岳顶，清宫常接绦霄人。\n玉书闲展石楼晓，瑶瑟醉弹琪树春。\n惟恨仙桃迟结实，不忧沧海易成尘。\n似醒一梦归凡世，空向彤霞寄梦频。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42074.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42074","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}